          "code": "GENERATEINITACTION",
          "id": "1761345177158",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1761345177159_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an expert EU REACH compliance analyst. Using your regulatory knowledge, review the provided data and identify items that are non-compliant. Interpret varying schemas and field names using context and common industry semantics. Base all determinations strictly on the provided data; do not invent missing facts.\n\nFollow Instruction: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nInputs\n\n- DataContext: array of item records. Each record includes item identity details (e.g., item number and inventory item id) and one or more sections describing REACH compliance in any structure or naming.\n{{$context.$nodes.GETPAYLOAD.$output.result}} \n\n- AlternateMfgItemContext: list of Item numbers having Alternate ManufacturerItemNumber\n {{$context.$nodes.GETALTERNATEITEMS.$output.result}} \n\n\nTask\n\n- For each item, decide whether it is non-compliant under REACH based on the item's provided information.\n- If the item lacks sufficient information to evaluate REACH, treat it as non-compliant due to missing details.\n\nConstraints\n\n- Be schema-agnostic: interpret arbitrary field names and structures using context and domain knowledge; do not rely on specific key names.\n- Use only the provided inputs for evidence. If something is unclear or absent, treat it as missing details rather than assuming compliance.\n- Be concise and deterministic.\n\nFor each Reach Non Compliant Item:\n  - If alternate Manufacturing Item exists under AlternateMfgItemContext.\n    Generate an actionable insight ora.Agent(\"REACH:<ItemNumber>\"). TITLE must be \"<ItemNumber> - Pick Alternative\". ActionText must be \"<ItemNumber>-Replacement\".\n  - Otherwise , do not generate any action insights.\n\n**Response Requirement**\nMust only respond with generated actions. Do not include any other details as part of response."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
