              "id": "1765837268082_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Generate email based on \n {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_DETAILS_FROM_ACTION_MESSAGE.$output.result}} \n\nGenerate a communication suggestion\n- description: \nBrief details of the issue along with  <ItemNumber>\n- actionText: \nSend Email - <ItemNumber>\n- title: \nReplacement Request\n- content: \n\"Please initiate required process to set the preferred Manufacturing item for the following:\n\nActual Item Number: <ACTUAL_ITEM_NO>\nNew Preferred Manufacturing Item: <MFG_ITEM_NO>\nEffective Date: <Today's date in format YYYY-MM-DD>\nReason/Justification: Reach Non compliance.\n\nRequested action\n\nUpdate the \"Preferred\" flag to <MFG_ITEM_NO> for <ACTUAL_ITEM_NO> effective <date>.\nEnsure downstream planning and sourcing rules reflect the preferred item.\"\n\n** Do not output anything else apart from communication suggestion.**"
            }
